{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I did my best to offer you an <strong>old school</strong> arcade game that would have evolved on a <strong>parallel timeline</strong>. <br><br>From a gameplay perspective it takes heavy inspiration from <strong>twin-stick shooting, roguelite, survivor and incremental</strong> games<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=1148 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With each run,</strong> change your arsenal with impactful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat waves </strong>and the<strong> boss</strong>\u00a0to unlock new <strong>levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And after each run,</strong> upgrade your character to progress ever further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit</strong> specific <strong>zones</strong> of the screen to get extra bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your weapon choice defines your gameplay.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a weapon you have to aim with for a classic, high-control <strong>twin-stick</strong> shooter experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, pick a weapon that <strong>aims automatically</strong>, letting you focus 100% on movement, dodging, and strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Build</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique upgrades to create a new death engine every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are just a few examples: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy bounce</strong>: Each time a bullet bounces, its damage is doubled. If you have fragments or DoTs they keep this boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser</strong>: You now shoot lasers that do 8x damage... You can only shoot up to 8 lasers in the air... But they can combine with fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong>: Your ship mimics the appearance of the enemies chasing you. They won't chase you unless you fire. Shooting breaks the disguise for a short time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=970 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each run by choosing your weapon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire at will, but be careful: you move more slowly while shooting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop XP that you have to manually collect. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be strategic You might want to <strong>hold on for a &quot;Double XP&quot; zone</strong> to appear before collecting it for a massive boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the lanes: different <strong>colored lanes</strong> give you more (or less!) powerful damage multipliers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note From the Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started life as a simple arcade game to toy with graphics made entirely of particles. <br>And it then evolved into an arcade-roguelite to conform to my tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development and receiving very frequent updates (targeting 4 to 6 new builds per week). I always listen to feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help shape the game, give it a try, and join the private testing, please contact me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your interest, I really appreciate !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I try to combine arcade fun with character building mechanics wrapped with a lot of particles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139330?t=1769089614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/843e14293b15242da8b58080222b8f4978873be0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769089614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/57c1a126ec53468c1459f117832859ccbb801d41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769089614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/57c1a126ec53468c1459f117832859ccbb801d41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769089614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4216980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I did my best to offer you an <strong>old school</strong> arcade game that would have evolved on a <strong>parallel timeline</strong>. <br><br>From a gameplay perspective it takes heavy inspiration from <strong>twin-stick shooting, roguelite, survivor and incremental</strong> games<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=1148 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With each run,</strong> change your arsenal with impactful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat waves </strong>and the<strong> boss</strong>\u00a0to unlock new <strong>levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And after each run,</st