_tag\" ><strong>Find Your Build</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique upgrades to create a new death engine every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are just a few examples: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy bounce</strong>: Each time a bullet bounces, its damage is doubled. If you have fragments or DoTs they keep this boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser</strong>: You now shoot lasers that do 8x damage... You can only shoot up to 8 lasers in the air... But they can combine with fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong>: Your ship mimics the appearance of the enemies chasing you. They won't chase you unless you fire. Shooting breaks the disguise for a short time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=970 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each run by choosing your weapon. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire at will, but be careful: you move more slowly while shooting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop XP that you have to manually collect. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be strategic You might want to <strong>hold on for a &quot;Double XP&quot; zone</strong> to appear before collecting it for a massive boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the lanes: different <strong>colored lanes</strong> give you more (or less!) powerful damage multipliers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bc4b4a3770b23deb97fb9b3a560a03b4.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note From the Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started life as a simple arcade game to toy with graphics made entirely of particles. <br>And it then evolved into an arcade-roguelite to conform to my tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in active development and receiving very frequent updates (targeting 4 to 6 new builds per week). I always listen to feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help shape the game, give it a try, and join the private testing, please contact me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your interest, I really appreciate !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR:</strong> I try to combine arcade fun with character building mechanics wrapped with a lot of particles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.poster.avif?t=1769089614\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.webm?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/bd98214b737319bb61167821b02fadeb.mp4?t=1769089614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Workshop Geek"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/bfcb9e4eee6cd4845bd24d9df94b577fa010ff86/header.jpg?t=1769089614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 3.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Celeron 300A<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Yes, you need one<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> I miss them<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I use arch btw</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/802009404/8018a4e9a15b6592f219638936b9059e31a708e0/1767790462/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767791415","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/802009404/8018a4e9a15b6592f219638936b9059e31a708e0/1767790462/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767791415","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/802009404/8018a4e9a15b6592f219638936b9059e31a708e0/1767790462/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767791415","id":257261053,"name":"Particulitix - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257261053/e9f0586ba3e9676ce779623758f07446322ea641/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767791415"}],"name":"Particulitix","